{
  "bookId": "activity-snippets-springfestivelantern",
  "id": "section-25950",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25950001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "孙大小姐驾到",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你们快看，我做好了一盏猫猫灯~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "看起来还不错，不过这只猫猫的原型是哪个赤炎大陆的名人呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶，花迦没有认出来吗？我还以为很容易就能猜到呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "猫猫的这身打扮看来是一位女将军，她神情冷酷，气场强大，我一时猜不到是哪位人物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "呵呵，原型确实就在我们身边哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "远在天边，近在眼前。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "够了，不要再讨论这个话题了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "生气了吗，这样会更容易穿帮哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "就是这个表情，这个花灯的原型就是孙大小姐，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "答对了，优纪就是以孙大小姐为原型作为灵感制作的哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "惟妙惟肖，眉目之间的神情尤其像呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "孙尚香",
          "text": "闭嘴，不要再说了，我警告你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "对不起，我们是不是惹孙大小姐不高兴了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25950015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "不要紧，只是在闹别扭而已，等一下就会好起来的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
